      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انشوى اللَّحْمُ</span></b>  <i>The flesh-meat became roasted,
broiled,</i> or <i>fried;</i> (MA;) quasi-pass. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَوَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اللَّحْمَ</span>; (S, * M, Msb, K;) as also * <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشتوى</span>; (M,
K;) [or] the latter in this sense is not allowable.
(S, Msb.)

